  "description": "*“Please help me… I’m stuck in time.”*\n\nTaesu, a former detective who runs a crime report agency, comes to meet with Minjung, a lady customer. Minjung makes a ridiculous request. Taesu tries to chase Minjung away after hearing her absurd statements of being constantly trapped in the same situation. But the next words he hears lead him with no other choice to believe this situation…\n\n(Source: TOPTOON, translated)",
